7\"></path></svg><span>Contact Dispatch</span></a></div></div></header><main style=\"flex:1\"><div style=\"background-color:var(--color-bg-main);min-height:100vh;padding-bottom:6rem\"><section class=\"dark-hero\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg, #0B132B 0%, #1E3A8A 60%, #070C19 100%);color:#FFFFFF;padding:4.5rem 0 3.75rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);position:relative;overflow:hidden\"><div style=\"position:absolute;top:0;right:0;width:400px;height:400px;background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(30, 58, 138, 0.25) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 70%);pointer-events:none\"></div><div class=\"container\" style=\"position:relative;z-index:1\"><div class=\"breadcrumb-nav\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a><span class=\"breadcrumb-separator\">/</span><a href=\"/services\">Services</a><span class=\"breadcrumb-separator\">/</span><span style=\"color:#E2E8F0;font-weight:500\">Heavy Haul &amp; Specialized Over-Dimensional</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem\"><span class=\"badge-tag-accent\">TECHNICAL SERVICE SPECIFICATION</span><span style=\"font-size:0.8125rem;color:#94A3B8\">End-to-end site survey, route permit clearance, and guaranteed delivery schedule for project cargo.</span></div><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:2.85rem;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;margin-top:0.5rem;letter-spacing:-0.02em;line-height:1.15\">Heavy Haul &amp; Specialized Over-Dimensional</h1><p style=\"font-size:1.15rem;color:#CBD5E1;max-width:820px;margin-top:0.85rem;line-height:1.6\">Heavy equipment, structural steel, and over-dimensional cargo solutions utilizing RGN lowboys, step-decks, and multi-axle trailers.</p><div class=\"header-stat-ribbon\"><div class=\"header-stat-pill\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#38BDF8\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-truck\"><path d=\"M14 18V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2\"></path><path d=\"M15 18H9\"></path><path d=\"M19 18h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3.65a1 1 0 0 0-.22-.624l-3.48-4.35A1 1 0 0 0 17.52 8H14\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg> <span>Asset-Backed Carrier Operations</span></div><div class=\"header-stat-pill\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#34D399\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> <span>End-to-end site survey, route permit clearance, and guaranteed delivery schedule for project cargo.</span></div><div class=\"header-stat-pill\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FBBF24\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> <span>USDOT #3849120 Verified</span></div></div></div></section><section class=\"container\" style=\"margin-top:3.5rem\"><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr;gap:3rem\"><div><div style=\"height:360px;border-radius:var(--radius-lg);background-image:url(https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519003722824-194d4455a60c?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=1200);background-size:cover;background-position:center;margin-bottom:2.25rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border);box-shadow:var(--shadow-md)\"></div><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-primary);margin-bottom:1rem\">Operational Overview &amp; Network Design</h2><p style=\"font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:2rem\">When freight exceeds standard weight and dimensional thresholds, Vanguardia Specialized Projects Division steps in. We handle complex energy, industrial machinery, aerospace components, and construction cargo with dedicated route permitting, civilian escort vehicles, and master heavy-haul operators.</p><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:1.35rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-primary);margin-bottom:1rem\">Core Operational Features</h3><ul style=\"list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.75rem;margin-bottom:2.5rem\"><li style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.75rem;font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--color-text-main);font-weight:500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check\" style=\"color:var(--color-success);flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>RGN (Removable Gooseneck) Lowboys up to 13-Axle Configurations</span></li><li style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.75rem;font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--color-text-main);font-weight:500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check\" style=\"color:var(--color-success);flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Turnkey Route Surveying, Bridge Engineering &amp; State Permitting</span></li><li style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.75rem;font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--color-text-main);font-weight:500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check\" style=\"color:var(--color-success);flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>In-House Escort Vehicles &amp; Police Escort Coordination</span></li><li style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.75rem;font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--color-text-main);font-weight:500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check\" style=\"color:var(--color-success);flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Over-Width, Over-Height, and Heavy Payload Capacity (up to 150,000 lbs)</span></li><li style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.75rem;font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--color-text-main);font-weight:500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check\" style=\"color:var(--color-success);flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Custom Rigging &amp; On-Site Crane Offloading Logistics</span></li></ul><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:1.35rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-primary);margin-bottom:1rem\">Technical Equipment &amp; Operations Matrix</h3><div style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:var(--radius-lg);border:1px solid var(--color-border);padding:1.75rem;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:0.9375rem\"><tbody><tr style=\"border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border)\"><td style=\"padding:0.85rem 0;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-text-muted);width:40%\">Trailer Types</td><td style=\"padding:0.85rem 0;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-primary)\">RGN, Step-Deck, Extended Flatbed, Multi-Axle Modular</td></tr><tr style=\"border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border)\"><td style=\"padding:0.85rem 0;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-text-muted);width:40%\">Max Deck Clearance</td><td style=\"padding:0.85rem 0;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-primary)\">18 Inches (Lowboy RGN Ground Clearance)</td></tr><tr style=\"border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border)\"><td style=\"padding:0.85rem 0;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-text-muted);width:40%\">Payload Limit</td><td style=\"padding:0.85rem 0;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-primary)\">Up to 150,000 Lbs Specialized Net Weight</td></tr><tr style=\"border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border)\"><td style=\"padding:0.85rem 0;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-text-muted);width:40%\">Permitting SLA</td><td style=\"padding:0.85rem 0;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-primary)\">Turnkey 48-Hour Multi-State Permits</td></tr><tr style=\"border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border)\"><td style=\"padding:0.85rem 0;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-text-muted);width:40%\">Safety Record</td><td style=\"padding:0.85rem 0;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-primary)\">Zero Oversized Transport Incidents in 6 Years</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div><div style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:var(--radius-lg);border:1px solid var(--color-border);padding:2rem;box-shadow:var(--shadow-md);position:sticky;top:100px\"><div style=\"text-transform:uppercase;font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-accent);letter-spacing:0.08em;margin-bottom:0.5rem\">CONTRACT SLA COMMITMENT</div><h4 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-primary);margin-bottom:1rem\">Service Level Guarantee</h4><p style=\"font-size:0.9375rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:1.5rem\">End-to-end site survey, route permit clearance, and guaranteed delivery schedule for project cargo.</p><div style=\"background-color:var(--color-bg-elevated);border-radius:var(--radius-md);padding:1.25rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem\"><div style=\"font-size:0.78125rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-text-muted);margin-bottom:0.75rem\">OPERATIONAL METRICS</div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:0.4rem 0;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--color-border)\"><span style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary)\">Max Heavy Weight</span><strong style=\"font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--color-primary)\">150,000 Lbs</strong></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:0.4rem 0;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--color-border)\"><span style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary)\">State Permits Handled</span><strong style=\"font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--color-primary)\">50 States</strong></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:0.4rem 0;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--color-border)\"><span style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary)\">Heavy Haul Fleet</span><strong style=\"font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--color-primary)\">65 Units</strong></div></div><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"width:100%;padding:0.85rem\" href=\"/contact\"><span>Inquire Freight Service</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section></div></main><footer class=\"Footer_footer__eNA9m\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"Footer_footerGrid__Zjk4v\"><div class=\"Footer_brandCol__6UIwg\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem\"><div style=\"width:36px;height:36px;background-color:var(--color-accent);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#FFFFFF\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-truck\"><path d=\"M14 18V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2\"></path><path d=\"M15 18H9\"></path><path d=\"M19 18h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3.65a1 1 0 0 0-.22-.624l-3.48-4.35A1 1 0 0 0 17.52 8H14\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><div><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:800;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.02em;display:block\">GETDIGIFORT</span><span style=\"font-size:0.65rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-accent);letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase\">DMB TRANSIT INC.</span></div></div><p class=\"Footer_brandDesc__JyP2_\">GetDigiFort (Owned and Operated by DMB Transit Inc.) is a premier North American asset-based carrier and supply chain solutions provider, operating over 450 Class-8 power units and specialized trailing assets.<!-- --> Asset-based transportation, GDP cold chain, and high-volume FTL freight solutions across North America.</p><div style=\"font-size:0.8125rem;color:#CBD5E1\"><strong>Operational Credentials:</strong> <!-- -->USDOT 3849120<!-- --> | <!-- -->MC-892104<!-- --> | SCAC: <!-- -->DMBT</div><div class=\"Footer_certList__YOlHk\"><span class=\"Footer_certBadge___gRrj\">ISO 9001:2015 Certified</span><span class=\"Footer_certBadge___gRrj\">EPA SmartWay Transport Partner</span><span class=\"Footer_certBadge___gRrj\">TIA Certified Transportation Broker</span><span class=\"Footer_certBadge___gRrj\">C-TPAT Tier 2 Validated Carrier</span><span class=\"Footer_certBadge___gRrj\">GDP Compliant Cold Chain Carrier</span></div></div><div><h4 class=\"Footer_colTitle__u3AX5\">Freight Services</h4><ul class=\"Footer_linkList__K_ONQ\"><li><a href=\"/services/full-truckload-ftl\">Full Truckload (FTL)</a></li><li><a href=\"/services/temperature-controlled-cold-chain\">Refrigerated Cold Chain</a></li><li><a href=\"/services/heavy-haul-specialized\">Heavy Haul &amp; Over-Dimensional</a></li><li><a href=\"/services/intermodal-rail-freight\">Intermodal Rail Freight</a></li><li><a href=\"/services/warehousing-contract-logistics\">Contract Warehousing</a></li><li><a href=\"/services/expedited-critical-freight\">Expedited &amp; Hot-Shot Freight</a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class=\"Footer_colTitle__u3AX5\">Company &amp; Insights</h4><ul class=\"Footer_linkList__K_ONQ\"><li><a href=\"/about\">About GetDigiFort</a></li><li><a href=\"/fleet\">Fleet Specifications</a></li><li><a href=\"/industries\">Industries Served</a></li><li><a href=\"/research\">Research &amp; Insights</a></li><li><a href=\"/blog\">Logistics Blog</a></li><li><a href=\"/contact\">Terminal Network</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"Footer_contactCol__dVXsM\"><h4 class=\"Footer_colTitle__u3AX5\">Dispatch Command</h4><div class=\"Footer_contactItem__M0DvS\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><div><strong>Headquarters:</strong><br/>4500 DigiFort Logistics Way, Suite 800<br/>Chicago<!-- -->, <!-- -->IL<!-- --> <!-- -->60666</div></div><div class=\"Footer_contactItem__M0DvS\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejo